    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but can u dig a bit deeper into why the communal stuff equals volatility? i'm wondering if there's a connection between those types of close-knit, large family/community structures and a higher likelihood of sudden life shifts or financial instability compared to someone more independent.",
